            {"text":"problema","start":31,"end":39,"lemmaId":2047667573}
          ],
          "grammarIds": [1,5,8,15]
        },
        {
          "it": "«Sì, mi dispiace. Non arriva l'acqua calda, e in casa fa molto freddo.»",
          "en": "\"Yes, I'm afraid so. There's no hot water, and it's very cold in the flat.\"",
